(text "CAM_ENABLE enables digital I/O first. CAM_ANALOG_ENABLE then enables analog and VCM and the DVP buffers." (at 16 166.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 725375dc-0853-5ff8-98e3-cf517bf74d89))
(text "With default PWDN high and RESET low: enable 1.8 V, wait for settling, enable 2.8 V, then wait at least 5 ms." (at 16 171.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 06166f61-e77d-5e64-99c9-c490e48a223a))
(text "Start XCLK, deassert PWDN, wait at least 1 ms, release RESET, then wait at least 20 ms before SCCB at 0x3C." (at 16 176.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 418f1b9b-65b9-59d7-9543-13b503cd525b))
(text "Shut down with PWDN high, RESET low, XCLK off, 2.8 V off and discharged, then switch off 1.8 V." (at 16 181.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 73b97887-b1b8-5380-95b1-5a8ecb7f2085))
